    "body": "Per https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/23137 implementations do not implement this as written (Chrome and Firefox fail both tests). However, that means different sites end up in the same agent cluster, which is somewhat fundamentally wrong. Or does anyone want to argue that data URLs are special enough that they can be an exception to that rule?\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/security ",
