    "created_at": "2020-04-27T16:42:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-27T16:42:30Z",
    "body": "I think for dedicated workers we could have gone both ways, but I think consistency with shared workers makes more sense for them as otherwise folks get really surprised with shared workers.",
